size.description:
Withdrawal quantity

Special notes for Bitcoin Lightning Network withdrawals:

This parameter must exactly match the amount on the Bitcoin Lightning Network deposit invoice;

The withdrawal quantity for Bitcoin Lightning Network represents the amount received, excluding fees;

The quantity precision can be obtained via the Get Coin Info API

